OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 begins worldwide
OL,4,Arelease after 13-year wait ` and the
OL,5,Aearly reviews are in
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has begun its
OL,8,Flaunch, ending gamers' 13-year wait for
OL,9,Fa new instalment
OL,11,FThe game launches at midnight around
OL,12,Fthe world, meaning gamers in New
OL,13,FZealand became the first to play at
OL,14,F11:00 GMT
OL,16,FInitial reviews give the game a score
OL,17,Fof 99, according to Metacritic
OL,19,FMany critics are praising it as
OL,20,F"exquisitely detailed" and "mature",
OL,21,Falthough some say it has "flaws"
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
